        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a set of Python files for managing secrets using a concrete external provider. The first file, fetch_api_key.py, needs to fetch an API key from a managed secrets store using Google Cloud Secret Manager. The other files will follow similar patterns, integrating with the same or different providers as required. </thinking>\n\n",
